                "recommended": "<strong>Recomendados:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo:</strong> 7 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Intel i5 2.5 GHz or Equivalent CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 8 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> GeForce GTX 760 or Radeon HD 7950 / R9 280 or Equivalent card<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 5 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> If you are planning to run a server and a client on the same machine we recommend 12-16 gigs of ram.</li></ul>"
