                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Abandoned nine years ago by BitMonster, cofounded by Matthew Tonks and Martin Sweitzer. Rather than finishing their game, they went on to join a whole brand new studio to try and develop a different game called Big Time, the studio sharing the same name. The fact that they still haven't taken the game down off the marketplace is a conscious decision to keep grifting money from people. A fact mirrored by coding in a timebomb to stop the game from running past a certain date. I really wish Steam would force this game off the marketplace as it is essentially abandonware.",
